Description: Smart AP+STA Wi-Fi hotspot manager for Linux
 twinfi lets you broadcast a Wi-Fi hotspot while staying connected to your
 existing Wi-Fi network simultaneously, without dropping your connection.
 .
 Includes:
  - twinfi        — CLI hotspot manager
  - twinfi-gtk    — GTK4/Libadwaita GUI (GNOME, KDE, Xfce, any GTK4 desktop)

